Beforehand, if the Owner can identify you, you will be notified of the breach.
If within fifteen calendar days you remedy it and do not repeat it, the licence
continues; otherwise, or if it cannot be remedied, it terminates. On termination
you must stop using the Program and delete your copies. This does not prevent
the Owner from taking the legal action available for the infringement.

Clauses 3, 4 bis, 6, 7 and 11 survive termination.

10. LICENCE CHANGES

The Owner may release future versions of the Program under different terms. That
